  "title": "Slow Cooker Corned Beef Reuben Sandwiches",
  "description": "This slow cooker corned beef and sauerkraut is simmered with spiced, dark beer for delicious open-faced toasted Reuben sandwiches on St. Paddy's Day.",
  "authors": [
    "snosin"
  ],
  "date_published": "2014-03-17T17:49:39-04:00",
